  "description": "The human world had long been peaceful, but that peace was shattered when other races set their sights on it. After many years, a truce was established, and the various races formed a joint police organization. One day, a human is assigned to an elite division, and standing before him is a demon…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2126000272), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/In_Dark), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/in_darkness), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_indark_wz), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=160368), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/none?ind=1437)  \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/48766908)",
